{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14955","headline":"春日陪李庶子遵善寺东院晓望 · 卢纶","name":"春日陪李庶子遵善寺东院晓望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"映竹水田分，当山起鴈羣。\n阳峰高对寺，阴井下通云。\n雪昼唯逢鹤，花时此见君。\n由来禅诵地，多有谢公文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14955.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14955","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}